{"3653930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demonbyte", "steam_appid": 3653930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonbyte</strong> is a brutal, over-the-top boomer shooter that throws you into a pixelated hellscape of demons, chaos, and relentless action. Inspired by <i>classic's from the 90's</i>, this is pure FPS mayhem with a futuristic twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 First-Person Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a lone space marine fighting off a demonic invasion powered by corrupted sci-fi tech. Armed with an arsenal of wild and ridiculous weapons — from futuristic swords, classic assault rifles to the now-infamous <strong>husky puppy handguns</strong> — every pull of the trigger brings satisfying destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Kill, Seek, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay demons, Find hidden secrets! Each level is packed with loot, secrets, and funny dialog to fuel your rampage. Build your loadout to suit your playstyle: go loud, go weird, or go wild.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Aesthetic Violence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring slick pixel art with a modern twist, <i>Demonbyte</i> blends old-school visuals with stylized effects and chaotic energy. Each level drips with atmosphere — industrial wastelands, techno-temples, and glitch-ridden voids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced, first-person combat</strong> inspired by retro classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of secrects and variety of weapons</strong>, including sci-fi melee tools and absurd firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted pixel art levels</strong> filled with secrets, traps, and enemy swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A signature sense of humor</strong> (Yes, that handgun really does look like a husky puppy.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to keep your adrenaline pumping</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚫 What This Game Is Not:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a cover shooter. There’s no hiding here. <i>Demonbyte</i> is about constant movement, skillful aim, and absolute chaos. If you stop moving, you die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(although u can always try to hide) 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a retro FPS veteran or a new player looking for stylish destruction, <i>Demonbyte</i> delivers pure demon-slaying, loot-grabbing, gun-blazing fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill. Seek. Repeat. Welcome to the byte.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonbyte</strong> is a brutal, over-the-top boomer shooter that throws you into a pixelated hellscape of demons, chaos, and relentless action. Inspired by <i>classic's from the 90's</i>, this is pure FPS mayhem with a futuristic twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 First-Person Carnage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a lone space marine fighting off a demonic invasion powered by corrupted sci-fi tech. Armed with an arsenal of wild and ridiculous weapons — from futuristic swords, classic assault rifles to the now-infamous <strong>husky puppy handguns</strong> — every pull of the trigger brings satisfying destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Kill, Seek, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay demons, Find hidden secrets! Each level is packed with loot, secrets, and funny dialog to fuel your rampage. Build your loadout to suit your playstyle: go loud, go weird, or go wild.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌌 Aesthetic Violence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring slick pixel art with a modern twist, <i>Demonbyte</i> blends old-school visuals with stylized effects and chaotic energy. Each level drips with atmosphere — industrial wastelands, techno-temples, and glitch-ridden voids.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced, first-person combat</strong> inspired by retro classics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of secrects and variety of weapons</strong>, including sci-fi melee tools and absurd firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted pixel art levels</strong> filled with secrets, traps, and enemy swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A signature sense of humor</strong> (Yes, that handgun really does look like a husky puppy.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> to keep your adrenaline pumping</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚫 What This Game Is Not:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a cover shooter. There’s no hiding here. <i>Demonbyte</i> is about constant movement, skillful aim, and absolute chaos. If you stop moving, you die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(although u can always try to hide) 😉</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a retro FPS veteran or a new player looking for stylish destruction, <i>Demonbyte</i> delivers pure demon-slaying, loot-grabbing, gun-blazing fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill. Seek. Repeat. Welcome to the byte.</strong></p>", "short_description": "fast-paced, retro-inspired boomer shooter where you blast through hordes of cyber-demons using outrageous weapons — including a husky puppy handgun. Inspired by classics from the 90's, every level drips with pixelated carnage, over-the-top firepower, and secrets to uncover.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653930/a2e5cb799766b1b31ca8eadc7cd8efdbbc6422f9/header.jpg?t=1763932489", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653930/b0fa985bfe2cf45ed77ca